{"id":"258c187258b044d2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-equationally-defined.md","title":"Equationally Defined","display":"df-equationally-defined — Equationally Defined","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-equationally-defined","aliases":["93-df-equationally-defined"],"display":"df-equationally-defined — Equationally Defined","depends_on":["[[93-df-equational-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-equationally-defined"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-equationally-defined</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equationally-defined — Equationally Defined"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> (a similarity type)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{K}\">\\(\\mathcal{K}\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebras)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqDef}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqDef}_{93}\\)</span> (equational-definability predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\\)</span> (equational-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equationally-defined} \\vdash \\mathrm{EqDef}_{93}(\\mathcal{K},\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal{K},\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equationally-defined} \\vdash \\mathrm{EqDef}_{93}(\\mathcal{K},\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal{K},\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus “equationally defined” is a naming bridge to the class property formalized in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>, rather than a second independent definition. Its second argument is the complete similarity type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>, matching that atom's signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equational-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}$ (equational-class predicate, see [[93-df-equational-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Thus “equationally defined” is a naming bridge to the class property formalized in [[93-df-equational-class]], rather than a second independent definition. Its second argument is the complete similarity type $\\tau$, matching that atom's signature.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqDef}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equationally-defined} \\vdash \\mathrm{EqDef}_{93}(\\mathcal{K},\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal{K},\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1008,"backlinks":[{"id":"d6711ee623831c0f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-equationally-defined]]"}],"outgoing":["55094a403a51c25e"]}